This repository contains a Khmer-language adaptation of the official Python
documentation. The original English documentation is written by the Python
documentation authors and licensed by the Python Software Foundation (PSF).

Per clause 2 of the PSF License Version 2, PSF's notice of copyright is
retained here:

    Copyright (c) 2001 Python Software Foundation; All Rights Reserved

Per clause 3, a brief summary of the changes made is given below.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY OF CHANGES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. The content is an independent Khmer-language rewriting/adaptation of the
   concepts documented in the CPython ``Doc/`` source tree (principally
   ``Doc/tutorial/``, ``Doc/using/`` and ``Doc/library/``). It is not a
   machine translation and not a verbatim reproduction of the English text.
2. Python syntax, keywords, function/class/module names, parameter names and
   API identifiers are deliberately left untranslated.
3. Code examples were rewritten and executed against CPython 3.15.0 to verify
   that they run correctly.
4. Scope is reduced relative to the upstream documentation: only the chapters
   listed in README.md are currently available in Khmer.
5. Site packaging (Sphinx configuration, ``khmer.css``, templates, Khmer
   web-font loading and the light/dark theme toggle) is original work of this
   repository and is licensed separately under LICENSE-CODE.
6. Trademarks: "Python" and the Python logo are trademarks or registered
   trademarks of the Python Software Foundation. This project is not endorsed
   or sponsored by the PSF. No PSF trademark is used here in a trademark sense.

